{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "train-libre F-Droid Repo"}, "description": {"en-US": "Automated F-Droid repository for train-libre"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "e0809c6a3aaa0bf8d544c1941196b5065fa044a62d3b2d12d47b4d773d72fb5e", "size": 818}}, "address": "https://rfivesix.github.io/train-libre/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1784838548000, "categories": {"Sports & Health": {"name": {"en-US": "Sports & Health"}}}}, "packages": {"com.rfivesix.trainlibre": {"metadata": {"added": 1784838540000, "categories": ["Sports & Health"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre/issues", "lastUpdated": 1784838541000, "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "webSite": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "screenshots": {"phone": {"de-DE": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "292b39132ca44d18aa7d2a5050a9f7a139253304817bec22a84aff1cec0f8fa8", "size": 437404}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "467fec3e1866253e867746f10ecf7233715fdafa413e17f54bdc94f6e6b50523", "size": 353619}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "df44400b68989841927421288676ee339add8d06dea9a3766eb7a499ad4f395a", "size": 256679}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "19834f166699ed5947956afff29053ed50ef4b4cceda3b34a013ba15140b8d1b", "size": 220548}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "82c07d82999fe574350a7381bdc7dca02f3826e2d40d324f1e946819150fbcc0", "size": 223554}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "30b4de83d618b42cfd21c61fea4ce13c50c96a3be00036af8d93cbe8e3328ed6", "size": 722695}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "86d901a45de5635edce8410f998dfe8d150b007c09345d9459e0e8f5513529c7", "size": 305025}], "en-US": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "ac033b63cb9785f99c37e0ddaf454f40951de95a140ef7de02f18b2ef1eb5d96", "size": 429429}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "633e220e8f7e8da35537213ed707398cfa8a84808791184f6e35347148eaf15f", "size": 357380}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "6041795aa06e085f62aba87b6e36e87a914aefda762bb76c9cbd1039592ba75b", "size": 235310}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "d21f946ae7a82dfe1c22f123cc4b9363f3c43f55973d2264bb36b12d38ad258c", "size": 217444}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "cbd5adc39df1d8efb628ec461346839c58c5c448edd3618722752d09b56289be", "size": 228586}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "5a83f209e4395ce93746dc70698dc6654497134e60626a7c2179258a9a9bd5f1", "size": 712596}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "97a24fb93e44f999499850d37d24ae6af6e50990ee26ac93f82779303ba85502", "size": 286300}]}}, "name": {"en-US": "Train Libre", "de-DE": "Train Libre"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Open-source workout and nutrition tracker with local-first data.", "de-DE": "Open-Source Tracker für Training und Ernährung mit lokalen Daten."}, "description": {"en-US": "Train Libre is an open-source, offline-first fitness tracker for people who want serious training and nutrition logging without giving up control of their data.\n\nFeatures:\n- Log workouts set by set, including warm-ups, working sets, failure sets, dropsets, reps, weight, and RIR\n- Build reusable routines and review completed sessions\n- Track nutrition, meals, hydration, caffeine, creatine, supplements, bodyweight, and body measurements\n- Use progress statistics for PRs, consistency, muscle volume, recovery, body trends, calories, sleep, steps, and pulse where available\n- Keep app data local by default, with export and import for local backups\n- Use integrated Open Food Facts and wger-based catalog sources\n- Export supported app-recorded data one way to Google Health Connect\n- Use optional AI meal features with your own API key, disabled by default\n\nWhat makes Train Libre different:\n- Open source and developed in public\n- Offline-first, with no mandatory cloud account\n- Built for structured gym tracking instead of gamification\n- Transparent analytics designed to be understandable and useful over the long term\n\nTrain Libre is not a medical app. Recovery, sleep, and pulse features are intended for training guidance and personal tracking only and are not medical diagnosis or treatment.\n\nOpen Source:\nThe source code is publicly available and the app is developed in the open.\n", "de-DE": "Train Libre ist ein Open-Source Fitness-Tracker für Menschen, die Training und Ernährung ernsthaft protokollieren wollen, ohne die Kontrolle über ihre Daten abzugeben.\n\nFunktionen:\n- Workouts Satz für Satz protokollieren, inklusive Aufwärmsätzen, Arbeitssätzen, Sätzen bis zum Versagen, Dropsets, Wiederholungen, Gewicht und RIR\n- Routinen erstellen, wiederverwenden und abgeschlossene Einheiten auswerten\n- Ernährung, Mahlzeiten, Hydration, Koffein, Kreatin, Supplements, Körpergewicht und Körpermaße tracken\n- Statistiken für PRs, Konsistenz, Muskelvolumen, Recovery, Körpertrends, Kalorien, Schlaf, Schritte und Puls nutzen, sofern Daten verfügbar sind\n- App-Daten standardmäßig lokal behalten, inklusive Export und Import lokaler Backups\n- Integrierte Datenquellen auf Basis von Open Food Facts und wger verwenden\n- Unterstützte selbst erfasste Daten einseitig zu Google Health Connect exportieren\n- Optionale KI-Mahlzeitenfunktionen mit eigenem API-Key nutzen, standardmäßig deaktiviert\n\nWas Train Libre besonders macht:\n- Open Source und öffentlich entwickelt\n- Offline-first, ohne verpflichtenden Cloud-Account\n- Gebaut für strukturiertes Krafttraining statt Gamification\n- Transparente Analysen, die langfristig verständlich und nützlich bleiben sollen\n\nTrain Libre ist keine medizinische App. Recovery-, Schlaf- und Pulsfunktionen dienen der Trainingsplanung und persönlichen Orientierung und stellen keine medizinische Diagnose oder Behandlung dar.\n\nOpen Source:\nDer Quellcode ist öffentlich verfügbar und die App wird offen entwickelt.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}, "de-DE": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}}, "preferredSigner": "7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"}, "versions": {"914a92c7f92571a3dd2810e51c72781ecab876f1edd996bf5c3683f33bd43bce": {"added": 1784838541000, "file": {"name": "/app-x86_64-release.apk", "sha256": "914a92c7f92571a3dd2810e51c72781ecab876f1edd996bf5c3683f33bd43bce", "size": 36578202}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86_64"], "versionName": "1.0.0-beta.2", "versionCode": 1004003, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 28}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_STEPS"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_SLEEP"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_HEART_RATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_WEIGHT"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_BODY_FAT"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_NUTRITION"}, {"name": "android.permission.healt